00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.320
because I just replaced
them by stronger points,

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.070
by stronger stations at the point in time.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.970
And the other thing that I
always find a little bit weird

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:14.803
when I read this,

00:09:14.803 --> 00:09:15.870
especially on a student CV

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.180
are things like being
an external consultant,

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:19.293
of course, this is always
a little bit weird,

00:09:19.293 --> 00:09:20.340
but you're a student,

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.390
why would a big company engage you

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.770
as an external consultant?

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.670
What type of experience was that?

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.760
So this always leaves some question marks.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.030
If then you scroll down,

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:29.863
I think the explanation is

00:09:29.863 --> 00:09:32.260
that this person worked
at Academy Consult.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.730
I just happen to know that organization

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:34.730
because they're from Munich,

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.560
they're a student based consulting firm.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.850
So this of course great,
great and relevant experience,

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.910
but then maybe just to
condense it a little bit,

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:41.990
you might be able to take

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.770
these external consulting positions

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.060
and then rather list them here,

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.720
for instance, within the
Academy Consult position,

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.370
just to make this a
little bit more intuitive

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.203
how exactly that went,

00:09:50.203 --> 00:09:51.727
and this will help you to save some space

00:09:51.727 --> 00:09:53.510
and also help the reader of the CV,

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:55.300
just in a more intuitive way understand

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.330
what exactly happened there.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.370
What exactly did you do here.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.070
Following the idea of saving space.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.260
Also things like language skills,

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.210
computer skills, hobbies,

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.130
these are things that
you can just very shortly

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:04.380
