00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.730
the date and the signature,

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.100
I know that many people tell you

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.490
that you need to include it.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:19.500
At least in Germany,

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.230
