00:10:24.573 --> 00:10:26.720
I always didn't see the
point of doing that.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.690
It always felt like a
waste of space to me.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.670
I would rather maybe sign the cover letter

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.687
if you wanna sign something.

00:10:32.687 --> 00:10:33.520
So judge this for yourself,

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.353
whether you wanna include it or not.

00:10:34.353 --> 00:10:35.900
For me, it was never a
problem to leave it out.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.680
But I do know that some people feel like

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.460
it needs to be included on every CV.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.310
So trust you will decide
what's right for you.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.143
As the last point,

