00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.183
what your impact was,

00:10:59.183 --> 00:11:01.030
what your contribution was.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.400
Also things like developing of market

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.920
