00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.330
a bit more in the future.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.200
So let's look at the next CV

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.790
and here again, first impression.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.270
What do we think about this?

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.680
I think what's very clear,

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:27.120
just for a side that
this CV is far too long.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.920
I mean, this is frankly just unacceptable.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:31.520
You cannot make a CV with six pages.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:34.500
Two pages should be the absolute maximum.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.900
I would recommend you to
only work with one page,

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.230
but six pages in just not okay.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.924
So let's just see what
this person did here.

00:11:40.924 --> 00:11:42.600
First of all, let's look at the alignment.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.433
I mean, here again,

00:11:43.433 --> 00:11:45.970
the bullet starts to the
right then further down,

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:46.860
it starts here to the left.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.290
And then if we go down,

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.200
we see things like this, for instance,

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.650
where then suddenly something
starts further to the right.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.070
I mean, this is surely not, okay.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.780
This is not what I would
recommend you to do.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.540
Then some other small sloppy
things in the formatting

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.520
let's notice how here

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.960
this longer dash is used.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.450
