00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:18.090
So I'd say the general recommended way

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.480
is that as long as you're are a student,

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.570
you start your CV after
the personal details,

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:23.750
with the education section,

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.320
because surely this is the
focus for you as a student.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:28.410
But as soon as you are a professional,

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.400
working professional who
moves out of university,

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.770
I'd say it's customary then to move up

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.220
the professional experience section,

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:38.140
and then only afterwards
show the education section

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:39.700
because surely this will usually be

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.290
