00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:48.200
like you would write
a paragraph in a book.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.950
So just full sentences,
full paragraph of text.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.530
It's just really difficult,

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.530
