00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:56.620
skim through it.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.650
And just in a straightforward way,

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:01.300
get the most important pieces
of information out of it.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.290
It really forces the people
to read through all of this

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:07.470
and this in combined with the
fact that the CV in itself

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.630
