person looking at that.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.320
I promise you the people will get annoyed

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.470
that will need to read this.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.390
Also the formatting,

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:18.200
this of course is just not really nice.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.140
You know,

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.870
